<title>USA: Ag Services files for NYSE listing.</title>
<headline>Ag Services files for NYSE listing.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR FALLS, Iowa 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ag Services of America Inc said Monday it filed an application to list its common stock on the New York Exchange.</p>
<p>The company expects trading to begin in mid-December under the symbol &quot;ASV.&quot;</p>
<p>Ag Services supplies seed, fertilizer, agricultural chemicals, crop insurance and cash advances for land rent, fuel and irrigation to farmers primarily in the central United States.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
